      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Design Layout:**\n\n1. **Top Center Banner (大标题):** \"Step into Style\"\n2. **Upper Left Corner (小标题):** \"Unleash Your Potential\"\n3. **Lower Right Corner (文案):** \"Every Stride, Every Story\"\n4. **Center Image:** A dynamic, high-resolution image of a pair of sleek, modern sneakers in action, possibly a runner in mid-stride against a vibrant, abstract background.\n5. **Lower Left Corner (品牌信息):** \"Innovation in Every Step\"\n6. **Upper Right Corner (促销信息):** \"New Arrivals\"\n\n**Design Concept:**\n\nThe poster is meticulously crafted to embody the dynamic and innovative spirit of modern sneakers. The top center banner, \"Step into Style,\" is set in a bold, contemporary typeface that immediately captures attention, encapsulating the essence of fashion and functionality.\n\nIn the upper left corner, the subtitle \"Unleash Your Potential\" is presented in a smaller, yet equally energetic font, suggesting a journey of self-discovery and achievement. This text is subtly outlined with a thin, neon stroke, enhancing its visibility and thematic resonance.\n\nThe centerpiece of the poster is a dynamic, high-resolution image of a pair of sleek, modern sneakers in action, possibly a runner in mid-stride against a vibrant, abstract background. This image is designed to be the visual anchor, inviting the viewer to imagine the possibilities and adventures that await.\n\nIn the lower right corner, the text \"Every Stride, Every Story\" is overlaid on a transparent gradient of geometric patterns, symbolizing the journey and the narrative behind every step. This combination of text and imagery creates a dynamic and engaging area of the poster.\n\nThe lower left corner features the brand's commitment to innovation, \"Innovation in Every Step,\" in a classic, sans-serif font, emphasizing the brand's dedication to cutting-edge technology and design.\n\nLastly, the upper right corner highlights new arrivals, \"New Arrivals,\" in a vibrant, eye-catching color to draw attention to the latest trends and styles.\n\n**Color Scheme:**\n\nThe color palette is thoughtfully selected to reflect the energetic and modern vibe of sneakers. Bright neon accents against a dark, abstract background create a visually appealing and cohesive design. The text colors are chosen to contrast effectively with the background, ensuring readability and impact.\n\n**Overall, the poster is a testament to top-tier design elements, including sophisticated typography, strategic use of color, and a harmonious integration of text and imagery, all working together to create a compelling and memorable visual experience.**"
      ]
    },
